NOTICE:  in object access: superuser finished drop (subId=0x0) [internal action,]
NOTICE:  in object access: superuser attempting alter (subId=0x0) [internal without auxiliary object]
NOTICE:  in object access: superuser finished alter (subId=0x0) [internal without auxiliary object]
